<title>HONG KONG: Kyongnam Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Kyongnam Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Standard Charted Investment Banking.</p>
<p>BORROWER  KYONGNAM BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$50 MLN   COUPON    6ML+45	MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    11.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 3	  CALLS     YR 3	  REPLIES   02.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING   LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS   --	    SALE LMTS --	    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   --	    CRS DEF   --	    FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  18.OCT.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MANAGERS  US$5   MLN+ 15 BP   ALL-IN 50 BP</p>
<p>	     CO-MANAGERS	 US$2-4 MLN  12 BP   ALL-IN 49 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS KDB ASIA, LTCB ASIA, MERRILL LYNCH FAR EAST,</p>
<p>	     STANDARD CHARTERED INVESTMENT BANKING</p>
<p>CO-ARGRS  YOKOHAMA ASIA, NISHI-NIPPON FINANCE (HK)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
